open nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8184em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.6426em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.782em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4158em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比特宽度</th>\n<th>模型大小压缩</th>\n<th>典型精度损失</th>\n<th>硬件支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP32→FP16</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1%</td>\n<td>几乎所有 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP32→INT8</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>0.5-1%</td>\n<td>TensorRT, ONNX Runtime, Edge TPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP32→INT4</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>部分 NPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二值化</td>\n<td>32x</td>\n<td>5-15%</td>\n<td>专用 FPGA/ASIC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>训练后量化（PTQ）</strong> 在训练完成后直接量化，无需重新训练。只需少量校准数据确定量化范围。PTQ 在 INT8 精度下通常可以将精度损失控制在 1% 以内。</p>\n<p><strong>量化感知训练（QAT）</strong> 在训练过程中模拟量化误差。使用直通估计器（Straight-Through Estimator, STE）解决量化操作不可微的问题——前向传播使用量化值，反向传播使用浮点梯度。QAT 在极低比特（INT4、INT2）下比 PTQ 有显著优势。</p>\n<p><strong>混合精度量化</strong> 为不同层分配不同的比特宽度。敏感层（如第一层卷积、分类头）使用较高精度，不敏感层（中间特征提取层）使用更低精度。HAWQ（Dong et al., 2019）使用 Hessian 矩阵特征值评估每层的量化敏感度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"硬件感知神经架构搜索\">硬件感知神经架构搜索</h3><p>传统 NAS 仅优化精度，硬件感知 NAS 将延迟或功耗作为联合优化目标。</p>\n<p><strong>One-Shot NAS / 超网络</strong>：训练一个包含所有候选操作的超网络（Supernet），通过参数共享将搜索成本从数千 GPU 天降低到数十 GPU 天。搜索时从超网络中采样子网络，评估其性能。</p>\n<p><strong>搜索空间设计</strong> 对 NAS 效果至关重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MobileNet-like 空间</strong>：搜索每个 block 的扩展比、核大小、是否使用 SE 模块</li>\n<li><strong>EfficientNet 空间</strong>：联合搜索深度、宽度和分辨率的缩放系数</li>\n<li><strong>Cell-based 空间</strong>：搜索 Normal Cell 和 Reduction Cell 的内部结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>硬件延迟预测器</strong>：在搜索过程中，每次评估子网络的真实延迟（需要在目标硬件上推理）太慢。延迟预测器（Lookup Table 或 Neural Network Predictor）基于操作类型和参数快速估计延迟。MnasNet（Tan et al., 2019）的延迟预测误差控制在 5% 以内。</p>\n<p>搜索目标通常采用多目标形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Acc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>LAT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>Target</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{\\alpha} \\; \\text{Acc}(\\alpha) \\times \\left[\\frac{\\text{LAT}(\\alpha)}{\\text{Target}}\\right]^w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4543em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Target</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LAT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是权重因子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.07</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\approx -0.07</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.07</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着每增加 5% 延迟惩罚约 0.35% 精度）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用 PyTorch 对 ResNet-50 进行知识蒸馏到 ResNet-18。在 CIFAR-10 上比较：直接训练 ResNet-18、用 ResNet-50 蒸馏到 ResNet-18、不同温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\in \\{1, 5, 10, 20\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的效果。</li>\n<li>对一个预训练 CNN 执行结构化剪枝：分别使用 L1-norm 和 Taylor 展开方法评估通道重要性。在 50% 剪枝率下比较两种方法的精度-速度权衡。</li>\n<li>使用 ONNX Runtime 或 TensorRT 对一个模型执行 INT8 PTQ。测量量化前后的模型大小、推理延迟和精度变化。尝试混合精度量化，观察不同层的量化敏感度。</li>\n<li>讨论：知识蒸馏、剪枝和量化是否可以组合使用？组合的最优顺序是什么？先蒸馏再剪枝，还是先剪枝再蒸馏？</li>\n<li>评估 NAS 在你的研究领域中的适用性：搜索空间如何定义？目标硬件是什么？搜索成本是否可接受？与手工设计的架构相比，NAS 的边际收益有多大？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>知识蒸馏</strong>：Hinton, Vinyals &amp; Dean, &quot;Distilling the Knowledge in a Neural Network&quot;（NeurIPS Workshop, 2015）</li>\n<li><strong>剪枝</strong>：He, Zhang &amp; Sun, &quot;Channel Pruning for Accelerating Very Deep Neural Networks&quot;（ICCV, 2017）；Frankle &amp; Carlin, &quot;The Lottery Ticket Hypothesis&quot;（ICLR, 2019）</li>\n<li><strong>量化</strong>：Gholami et al., &quot;A Survey of Quantization Methods for Efficient Neural Network Inference&quot;（arXiv, 2021）——最全面的量化综述</li>\n<li><strong>NAS</strong>：Cai, Zhu &amp; Han, &quot;ProxylessNAS: Direct Neural Architecture Search on Target Task and Hardware&quot;（ICLR, 2019）</li>\n<li><strong>综合</strong>：Menghani, &quot;Efficient Deep Learning: A Survey on Making Deep Learning Models Smaller, Faster, and Better&quot;（ACM Computing Surveys, 2023）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模型压缩和硬件感知 NAS 是深度学习模型从云端走向边缘的两大使能技术。知识蒸馏通过教师-学生框架传递暗知识（dark knowledge），使小模型接近大模型的泛化能力。网络剪枝通过移除冗余参数减小模型体积，结构化剪枝产生硬件友好的稠密小模型。量化将浮点运算映射到低比特整数运算，在 INT8 精度下几乎无损压缩 4 倍。硬件感知 NAS 从搜索之初就将目标硬件的延迟和功耗约束纳入优化目标，直接在精度-效率帕累托前沿上找到最优架构。这些技术可以组合使用——先 NAS 设计高效架构，再蒸馏提升精度，再量化压缩部署——形成从云到端的完整优化链路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士智能系统 — 模型压缩与边缘神经架构搜索","id":"博士智能系统-模型压缩与边缘神经架构搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"知识蒸馏","id":"知识蒸馏"},{"level":3,"text":"网络剪枝","id":"网络剪枝"},{"level":3,"text":"量化","id":"量化"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件感知神经架构搜索","id":"硬件感知神经架构搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士智能系统 — 自适应人机编队","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/human-ai-interaction/adaptive-human-machine-teaming"},"next":{"title":"博士智能系统 — 联邦学习与隐私保护 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/edge-intelligence/federated-learning-privacy"}}